Changes
=======

v4.0.2 1 July 2026
  * Bump `github.com/lestrrat-go/jwx/v4` to v4.1.0.

v4.0.1 7 May 2026
  * Bump `github.com/lestrrat-go/jwx/v4` to v4.0.2.

v4.0.0 19 Apr 2026
  * First stable v4 release. Tracks github.com/lestrrat-go/jwx/v4 v4.0.0.

v4.0.0-alpha4 17 Apr 2026
  * Switch registration to jwx.Settings(jwx.WithBase64Encoder(...), jwx.WithBase64Decoder(...)).
    Requires jwx/v4 v4.0.0-scratch.23 or later, which removed jwx.SetBase64Encoder /
    jwx.SetBase64Decoder in favor of the unified Settings entry point.

v4.0.0-alpha3 13 Apr 2026
  * Compatibility release for jwx/v4 v4.0.0-scratch.15. No code changes.

v4.0.0-alpha2 8 Apr 2026
  * Compatibility release for jwx/v4 v4.0.0-scratch.12. No code changes.

v4.0.0-alpha1 8 Apr 2026
  * Initial version, assembly-optimized base64 backend for github.com/lestrrat-go/jwx/v4.
